%% alt: The six ways in and out of an AI application. They are user prompts; untrusted content from the web, email and uploads; retrieval from documents and the vector store; and tool calls to business systems. They also include the supply chain of models, packages and tool servers, and logs sent to telemetry. The application also calls the model.
flowchart TB
  U[User]:::human -->|1 prompts| APP[Application]:::tool
  EXT[Web, email, uploads]:::untrusted -->|2 untrusted content| APP
  KB[(Documents and<br/>vector store)]:::data -->|3 retrieval| APP
  SC[Models, packages,<br/>tool servers]:::untrusted -.->|5 supply chain| APP
  APP --> M[Model]:::model
  APP -->|4 tool calls| T[Tools and<br/>business systems]:::tool
  APP -->|6 logs| LOG[(Telemetry)]:::data
